    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/listening-01.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/listening-01.wav",
      "script": "あねが、ひとりいます。おとうとは、いません。",
      "sha256": "b5df89840faf71992755114e66b3c3b07da02a72e5962e524c9c3ce6bd45e0e1",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/listening-02.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/listening-02.wav",
      "script": "こうえんに、ははとそぼがいます。ははは、あかいかばんをもっています。そぼは、あおいかばんをもっています。あおいかばんのひとを、さがしてください。",
      "sha256": "98bd83ce5611c747493639db2298f7e505a6cacc8d8efd2e18373b67653bc3b7",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/listening-03.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/listening-03.wav",
      "script": "かぞくは、よにんです。ちちと、ははと、いもうとと、わたしです。",
      "sha256": "8bd11c0358137e7df1ff23237906331c1f30260417f66dfac643f03b076973c5",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/listening-04.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/listening-04.wav",
      "script": "ひとり。ふたり。さんにん。よにん。",
      "sha256": "4d1951fde37448d60e501dc43414ecd3750ffc8972c7290fcc84f0fbe0170df5",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/listening-05.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/listening-05.wav",
      "script": "きょうだいが、いますか。",
      "sha256": "14156b1ebe34093e89becb71c3a35fd2bb9591f6788108933b4220a08c9474c8",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/listening-06.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/listening-06.wav",
      "script": "かぞくは、なんにんですか。",
      "sha256": "579aaf68af3c03cfaf963b69fd909d4937d35336ef08100bb6c994641cd9796b",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-words-1.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-words-1.wav",
      "script": "ちち。はは。あに。あね。おとうと。",
      "sha256": "b086096bd60877b1a5233f52fc361e2cd0c7ca86f4c19372d7e733e00e97671e",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-words-2.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-words-2.wav",
      "script": "いもうと。そふ。そぼ。おとうさん。おかあさん。",
      "sha256": "f1082eeac80f57a5f9867e65ef67fe1eda67dc863a342378a670832b8ab3361d",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-words-3.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-words-3.wav",
      "script": "おにいさん。おねえさん。おじいさん。おばあさん。かぞく。",
      "sha256": "256139d3039102008bec17e827916489279df58a13a91c78d8426cd198e6524c",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-words-4.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-words-4.wav",
      "script": "きょうだい。おとこのこ。おんなのこ。こども。おとな。",
      "sha256": "4c0f2e7d1d5a88278058b0f288aa7e517df97b335cf98fcc37d6379343dd4173",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-words-5.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-words-5.wav",
      "script": "おじ。おば。いとこ。りょうしん。なんにん。",
      "sha256": "37cde8bb2b1639e3f3290697e4a6e4ef9c2857919b3e72b37ae49863480f7a77",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-kanji.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-kanji.wav",
      "script": "ちち。はは。あに。あね。こ。こども。",
      "sha256": "2d4ca603e8aa938654831025fa78dfe01b5a248974ca8a817992efbdd1ccf14e",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-G13.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-G13.wav",
      "script": "あにとあね。ちちとははがいます。あにとあねとわたし。ちちのははは、そぼです。",
      "sha256": "a45a586174a0e055da373a0007a99d648a9a72ed6152be9d47af83a99e0ceb0e",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-G14.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-G14.wav",
      "script": "ひとり。ふたり。さんにん。よにん。ごにん。ろくにん。なんにんですか。さんにんです。",
      "sha256": "9cc519ff5c495d3575960d403389aaf36314e89909ceb41db8c22991ddf49bc1",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-G15.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-G15.wav",
      "script": "あねがひとりいます。いもうとがふたりいます。おとうとはいません。きょうだいがいますか。はい、あにがいます。",
      "sha256": "8fa622b62512892dd5124ee4425a238ebd240009fc9f78a3371d9dd3dbab542c",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-story.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u05/U05-teach-story.wav",
      "script": "だれですか。そぼです。なんにんですか。ふたりです。そぼとわたしです。",
      "sha256": "33c34d8aca165b7ab6a68755c0de62cbf8f8c07f2cf13a7eb37bd5033c8cfde1",
